the same Qlogic card. I was getting I/O errors when trying to write to and
erase tapes. I was using 'mt' at first, then I installed flexbackup from
ports. Flexbackup uses 'mt' commands, so that did not work for me as well.

So, I installed a SymBios PCI SCSI card into my machine and hung the tape
drive off of it, by itself. I ran through the same procedures as above, I
used 'mt' to rewind and erase tapes, rather 'mt' attempted to erase the
