> >
> > I build kde 3.0.3 from ports on a PWS 500a (21164A CPU) 2 or three days
> > ago after a cvsup of the ports tree - I didn't encounter any errors.
> > kdegraphics is there, kdeadmin not. I'll try to build kdeadmin seperatly
